            <div xml:id="d594">

                <pb facs="0960" n="840" sameAs="frus:frus1932v01/pg840"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.S1/374: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland (Wilson) to the Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-12-03T21:00:00+01:00">December 3, 1932—9
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 3—5:22 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>54. From Davis. Your 418 November 26, 2
                    p.m. to Paris. League Secretariat has been advised of views of American experts
                    regarding inclusion China member on Preparatory Commission and regarding <pb
                        facs="0961" n="841" xml:id="pg841"/> their desire for some delay in fixing
                    actual date in January for next meeting. In view of necessity of prompt
                    notification of other members of Preparatory Commission would appreciate early
                    cabled advice regarding date. [Davis.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
